{"articleNo":"470333","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=470333&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2023 학생창업자 지원 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.12.04","hit":"5275","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">안녕하세요.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">국립금오공과대학교 창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">창업교육센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">산학협력단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(LINC3.0</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">사업단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">지원으로 창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">창업교육센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">에서 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">휴학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">들의 창업 활성화를 위하여&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">년도 학생창업자들에 대한 창업지원비를 지원하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">상세 내용은 아래와 같습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><br><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">지 원 대 상&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2023.03.01. ~ 2024.02.28&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">기간에 창업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">사업자등록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">한 재학생 및 휴학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">미창업자 중&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">24.02.28</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">일까지 사업자등록을 할 창업예정자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">제 출 서 류&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">사업자등록증 사본&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">부</span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">접 수 기 한&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2024. 02. 23.(금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">제 출 방 법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">방문 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">벤처창업관&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">313</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">호</span></p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">이메일 제출&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">- rnwldms92@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">사업자등록증 제출하면서 본인 이름</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학번</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">휴대폰 번호 함께 적어서 보내주세요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">!</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">지 원 내 용&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:<b>&nbsp;최대</b>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">500,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">원 상당의 상품권(생활협동조합)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;*선착순 지급예정(최대 50만원임으로 해당 금액은 변경될 수 있습니다.)</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">위의 지원대상에 충족하는 학생이 있다면 사업자등록증을 창업교육센터에 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">제출 시 꼭 본인 이름</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학번</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">휴대폰 번호 기입해서 보내주세요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">▶&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">해당 사항 확인 후 생협 상</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">품권 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">상품권의 경우 생활협동조합 상품권&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">만원권 최대&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">50</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">장으로 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">실물 상품권 구매 후 제공까지 조금의 시간이 걸릴 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.]</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조;\">문의 및 연락처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 054-478-7897~8, rnwldms92@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
